    "title": "Beignets & Brew plans first Birmingham-area location in Homewood - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By STAFF ,\n14 hours ago A new coffee and pastry shop specializing in New Orleans-inspired treats is planned for 1625 Oxmoor Road in Homewood. Beignets & Brew, a Florida-based café concept, will occupy the former Bitty & Beau’s space and marks the company’s first location in the Birmingham area as it continues expanding across Alabama. Read full article\n1",
